WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.801
-It's good to see you, bud. You look good.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:03.801
-I love the Roots, man. -Yeah, you do?

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.400
I do. I love the Roots, too.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.667
They're the greatest. Come on.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:08.834
[ Applause ]

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.801
I have a lot of things I want to ask you.

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:12.567
First of all, thanks for being here.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:13.801
You look great. -Thanks.

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.200
-Last time you were here, you were talking to me,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.868
you said, "Jimmy." You got invited to the

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:18.367
Celebrity NBA All-Star Game,

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:20.701
and you said, "I'm taking it seriously.

00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:22.400
I'm taking this seriously." -You want to bring that --

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.367
You want to bring that -- Why you wanna...?

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:26.167
-'Cause I kind of know the ending.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:30.534
You said you want to be MVP this year. You wanted --

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.601
Tell me exactly what you did again last time.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:35.133
-So, at the time -- When I -- Before -- Okay.

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:39.634
So I got selected to play in the NBA Celebrity All-Star Game.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:43.000
And, you know, me and my good friend Hannibal Buress, also.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.300
-That's right. -We hired a basketball trainer

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.234
to get us ready for the game, right?

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:49.767
-Yeah. -So, I'm like, "Yo.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.934
I'm about to get 15-5-5."

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.000
Right? That was the goal.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.667
What happened was, uh, when I got to the game --

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.767
This is a true story. I got in the layup line.

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:03.167
And look, I'm in my 40s, man. You know what I mean?

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:04.868
-Wait. I'm sorry. The layup line?

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.300
-Let me tell you what happened. I was in the layup line.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.400
And I felt a little twinge in my knee.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.667
And in that moment, I made a decision.

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:17.234
I said, "Look, do you want to still be making movies?

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.234
Or be in crutches? What do you want to do?"

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:22.367
-[ Laughs ] Oh, my God. -And so -- This is a true story.

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:24.067
I went to the locker room. I changed shoes.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.901
I don't know why I -- Let me tell you something.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.267
Anybody who plays basketball,

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.367
you know you need to break some shoes in.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.667
I put on some fresh shoes.

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:32.701
-My gosh. This sounds like a nightmare.

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:36.868
-Okay, and then something crazy happened...

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:38.801
-Look. No big deal. It's just we have a clip.

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:40.133
-No, you don't.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:45.367
-Here's Lil Rel Howery at the Celebrity All-Star Game.

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:46.734
Take a look at this.

00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:49.234
-Chance the Rapper's brother driving into traffic.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.334
Yeah, tail -- Oh, no. I told you, I told you.

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:54.901
We're laughing about it. He's still dead serious.

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.334
Let's get the replay of what happened.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:59.234
Here's Lil Rel go -- Oh, no, no, no, no, no!

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:01.234
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:05.501
-No one around you! There was no one around you.

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:07.868
Rel! There was no one touching you.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:10.567
-People don't realize how grippy the NBA floors are.

00:02:10.567 --> 00:02:12.868
You know what I mean? -Grippy? The floors are grippy?

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:14.801
-They don't have pickup-game grip.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.167
It's like NBA grip is totally different grip.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.634
-So it's extra grippy? -It's extra grippy.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:19.834
-So, when you're walking around --

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.133
So you're just gripped to the floor?

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:23.868
&gt;&gt; [Bleep]. It was so much grip.

00:02:23.868 --> 00:02:26.300
-You just fell down. What happened?

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:29.300
-I'll tell -- Let me say this. I did take it way too serious.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.234
I should have had more fun. Like, I was way too focused.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.934
Like, even when they did the intros, I was like really --

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:35.267
You know, audience want to shake your hand.

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:36.734
I'm like, "No, I'm good."

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:38.400
You know, I'm chewing my gum all hard, so...

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.400
-Oh, my God. Ridic-- But you're such a funny guy.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.334
Don't you want to just be -- -I don't know, man!

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:44.167
I always wanted to play in the NBA!

00:02:44.167 --> 00:02:46.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:48.801
-Did anyone give you any advice?

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:54.901
But Stephen A. Smith was your coach, right?

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.834
-Let me tell you. Stephen A. Smith is mean.

00:02:56.834 --> 00:02:59.234
You know what I mean? Look, this is a celebrity game.

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.567
You're supposed to give everybody playing time.

00:03:01.567 --> 00:03:04.033
But after the trip, he necessarily didn't want

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:06.300
to put me back in. [ Laughter ]

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.200
So I'm on the bench the whole time just looking at them.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.901
I'm trying to be extra to everybody else.

00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:11.033
"Y'all got this!"

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:12.834
-You're like, "Put me in, Coach."

00:03:12.834 --> 00:03:15.767
-I'm just looking at them like a little kid.

00:03:15.767 --> 00:03:18.767
I wish my dad was there. "Could you talk to him?"

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.467
-I want to talk about your special.

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:22.267
Congrats on this. -Thank you so much.

00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:26.801
-"Lil Rel Howery: I Said It, Y'all Thinking It."

00:03:26.801 --> 00:03:29.367
Great line. Where did the line come from?

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:32.100
-It really came from -- I did the Espys earlier this year,

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.000
and I made a joke about Tristan Thompson.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.434
And the crowd was like "Ooh, ohh."

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:39.267
And I was like, "I said it! Y'all thinking it!"

00:03:39.267 --> 00:03:40.901
[ Laughter ] And I was like,

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:42.667
"Wait a minute. That's a great name for a title!"

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:44.901
-Yeah, yeah. "That's the title of my special," yeah.

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:46.934
And you went to your hometown, went to Chicago.

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:49.367
-Went to Chicago. Shot it at the Chicago Theatre.

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:52.501
Both shows. Line around the corner.

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.534
-But then you also did a cool thing on top of that.

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:56.267
You paid for the entire audience's ticket.

00:03:56.267 --> 00:03:57.601
-Yeah, I -- You know what's interest--

00:03:57.601 --> 00:03:59.267
[ Cheers and applause ] Yeah, y'all -- It was free.

00:03:59.267 --> 00:04:00.901
-That's gotta feel good, right?

00:04:00.901 --> 00:04:03.267
-I mean, one of the reasons why I did it is --

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:05.400
First of all, I wanted it to be a gift to Chicago.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.234
Because they -- Where I'm at now is because of Chicago.

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:11.200
All those, like, shows and hole-in-the-wall spots I did.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.801
Those people came out and made sure --

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:14.467
They came to laugh, support me.

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:16.567
And it built my confidence and my comedy up.

00:04:16.567 --> 00:04:17.767
And also, too, I'm like,

00:04:17.767 --> 00:04:19.634
people feel happier when they don't pay.

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:21.300
Y'all happy, ain't y'all?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.133
[ Cheers and applause ] They're happy. They are happy.

00:04:24.133 --> 00:04:26.000
-They're happy when they don't pay.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.767
-When it's free, people are happy.

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:32.234
-I want to show a clip, and this is the most friendly --

00:04:32.234 --> 00:04:34.467
TV-friendly clip that we could show.

00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:36.801
-I mean, look. I did a lot of cussing.

00:04:36.801 --> 00:04:38.100
That's just what it is.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.634
-Congrats, by the way, on the great reviews.

00:04:39.634 --> 00:04:40.868
You're on, like, the top ten list

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:42.434
of every standup special out there right now.

00:04:42.434 --> 00:04:44.067
So this is you, buddy. -Thank you so much.

00:04:44.067 --> 00:04:45.834
I appreciate that. -That's what I'm talking about.

00:04:45.834 --> 00:04:47.300
Here's a little peek at

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.367
"Lil Rel Howery: I Said It, Y'all Thinking It."

00:04:49.367 --> 00:04:51.100
Take a look at this.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.968
-You get some money, you be like,

00:04:52.968 --> 00:04:55.200
"Oh, I ain't gonna have no roaches, 'cause I'm good now."

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.133
Mnh-mnh. Some new [bleep]. Ants!

00:04:58.133 --> 00:05:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.834
And they are worse than [bleep] roaches.

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:03.467
They work together [bleep].

00:05:03.467 --> 00:05:05.434
You know, ants be marching together.

00:05:05.434 --> 00:05:08.000
They be marching like a choir. [Bleep]

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.300
All through your bathroom. [Bleep].

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.367
You don't know where that pathway started!

00:05:13.367 --> 00:05:15.434
I'm like, "Where the [bleep] y'all going?"

00:05:15.434 --> 00:05:16.901
They got 15 fries. "Where the [bleep]

00:05:16.901 --> 00:05:18.634
y'all find those fries at?!"

00:05:18.634 --> 00:05:20.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.868
♪ We're marching, we're marching up in your bathroom ♪

00:05:23.868 --> 00:05:26.834
♪ That beautiful sink of God ♪

00:05:26.834 --> 00:05:28.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:30.667
-Lil Rel Howery, everybody!

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.067
His new special,

00:05:32.067 --> 00:05:34.033
"Lil Rel Howery: I Said It, Y'all Thinking It,"

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:36.100
is streaming now on HBO Max.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.634
We'll be right back with Clive Davis. Stick around.

